    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Overview\n\nAutomatically monitors pending order confirmations every 5 minutes. If an order remains unconfirmed for more than 5 minutes, a Slack alert is sent to the store owner.\n\n## Purpose\n\nTo ensure orders are confirmed on time, prevent delays, and notify the owner when the call team misses or delays an order confirmation.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 352
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -320,
        528
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a7076b4a-03f8-442e-8b62-a6a625ec62ba",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node by Node\n\n### 1. Schedule Trigger\nRuns automatically every **3 minutes**.\n\n### 2. Google Sheets\nFetches all orders where the **`call_order_confirm`** status is **`Pending`**.\n\n### 3. Calculate Time\nCalculates the time difference between the order creation time and the current time (e.g., {\"minutesAgo\": 4}).\n\n### 4. Switch\nChecks whether the order has been pending for **more than 5 minutes**. If true, the workflow continues.\n\n### 5. Slack\nSends a Slack notification to the store owner, informing them that the order has not been confirmed by the call team.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1648,
        432
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "0796afa0-dc6f-448e-811e-c32618afdfb1",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node by Node\n\n### 1. Schedule Trigger\nRuns automatically every **3 minutes**.\n\n### 2. Google Sheets\nFetches all orders where the **`call_order_confirm`** status is **`Completed`**.\n\n### 3. Gmail\nSends a confirmation email to the customer, informing them that their order has been confirmed and is now being processed.\n\n### 4. Slack\nSends a Slack notification to the packaging team with the order details so they can begin preparing the order.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
